Description: CaramOS App Center: first-run app picker and app store
 Lets CaramOS users choose an office suite, web browsers, chat apps and
 everyday tools, each with its strengths and weaknesses, the first time they
 log in, and install or remove them later from the menu.
 .
 Apps come from Flathub when the publisher maintains them there, otherwise
 from the publisher's own package. A polkit-protected helper only accepts app
 IDs from the packaged catalog. Apps beyond the suggestions are on
 apps.vietnamlinuxfamily.net.
